# Dispelling Exhale: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may behold a Dragon. Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2}.
# If a Dragon was beheld, counter that spell unless its controller pays {4} instead." Behold is CR 701.4a: choose a Dragon you control (here
# the Phyrexian Dragon Engine, an artifact creature) or reveal one from your hand; nothing moves, so the Engine stays on the battlefield.
# Bot2's Black Lotus leaves {R}{R} after the Bolt - enough for {2}, not for {4} - so the Bolt is countered. The twin scenario that casts
# it without beholding is "...without-beholding-asks-two-and-the-bolt-is-paid-for".

